{"suttaId":"thi-ap16","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[7194,7225],"vripara":"86"},"segments":{"thi-ap16:0.3":"Naḷamālikātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap16:1.1":"“Candabhāgānadītīre, ahosiṃ kinnarī tadā;","thi-ap16:1.3":"Addasaṃ virajaṃ buddhaṃ, sayambhuṃ aparājitaṃ.","thi-ap16:2.1":"“Pasannacittā sumanā, vedajātā katañjalī;","thi-ap16:2.3":"Naḷamālaṃ gahetvāna, sayambhuṃ abhipūjayiṃ.","thi-ap16:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap16:3.3":"Jahitvā kinnarīdehaṃ [mānasaṃ dehaṃ (sī. pī. ka.) sumedhāvaggepi], tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap16:4.1":"“Chattiṃsadevarājūnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap16:4.3":"Manasā patthitaṃ mayhaṃ, nibbattati yathicchitaṃ.","thi-ap16:5.1":"“Dasannaṃ cakkavattīnaṃ, mahesittamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap16:5.3":"Ocitattāva [sucitattāva (pī.)] hutvāna, saṃsarāmi bhavesvahaṃ.","thi-ap16:6.1":"“Kusalaṃ vijjate mayhaṃ, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ;","thi-ap16:6.3":"Pūjārahā ahaṃ ajja, sakyaputtassa sāsane.","thi-ap16:7.1":"“Visuddhamanasā ajja, apetamanapāpikā;","thi-ap16:7.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap16:8.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ buddhamabhipūjayiṃ;","thi-ap16:8.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, naḷamālāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","thi-ap16:9.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap16:10.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap16:11.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap16:12.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ naḷamālikā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap16:13.1":"Naḷamālikātheriyāpadānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
